      "content": "it's just so heavy. like, every single day is just more of the same, just more watching things disappear or get broken. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to feel this weight anymore. if there was just... stillness. do you think there's any dignity in walking away before everything is completely gone?",
